286 0 obj
<<
/Title (Each section header was renamed by double-clicking it and typing the section title, and fields within a section were reordered using drag handles until the layout matched the intended member journey from identity to health declaration. 5. Applying Field-Level Validations 1. Selected Member_Name, Contact_Number, Age, Membership_Type, Membership_Plan, and Health_Declaration_Waiver one by one and enabled the Mandatory toggle in Field Properties. 2. Opened Email_Address properties and confirmed the built-in email format validation was active. 3. Opened Contact_Number properties and set the phone format to the Indian country-code pattern. 4. Opened Age properties and set Minimum Value = 14 and Maximum Value = 75. 5. Opened Preferred_Start_Date properties and restricted selectable dates to today and future dates only, disallowing past dates. 6. Confirmed under Health_Declaration_Waiver that the Submit button remains disabled until the checkbox is checked. 6. Preview and Deployment 1. Clicked the Preview icon in the Form Builder toolbar to view the live member-facing form and verified that all four sections render in order with correct field types.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 288 0 R
/Next 283 0 R
>>
endobj
